Based on the provided documents and images, this is a **monolithic-to-microservices migration project** for a financial fraud detection system (likely ANZ's **Falcon Insto**). Your role involves building new microservices to replace legacy mainframe components, focusing on real-time (RT) and near-real-time (NRT) fraud checks for bulk payments. Below is a **task-wise breakdown** with code-level guidance:

